    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεντρ-ίτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεντρίνης</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κάλαμος</span>
			<i>prickly</i> reed, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				152
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεντρ-ῖτις</span></b> ,
